--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Software" means the source code, object code, binaries, schema files,
generated artifacts (including BPF filter tables), documentation and any other
material in this repository, together with all modifications, translations,
adaptations and Derivative Works of any of them.

"Derivative Work" has the meaning given in Article 2 of the Berne Convention
and Section 101 of the U.S. Copyright Act, and additionally includes, without
limitation: (a) any work that incorporates, links against, subclasses,
wraps, patches or otherwise reuses any part of the Software; (b) any
translation into another programming language; (c) any reimplementation
produced by extracting design decisions from the Software rather than from
independent public sources.

"Official Build" means a binary produced by the copyright holder, or produced
by you by compiling an unmodified copy of this repository with the build
procedure documented in build/build.sh.

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
license, and any entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common
control with that entity.

"Commercial Use" means any use by, for, or on behalf of an entity in
connection with a product or service from which that entity derives revenue,
directly or indirectly, including internal production use.

