11. ASSUMPTION OF RISK — SECURITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software is NOT a security sandbox. It is a single-process design intended
to improve performance and compatibility, not to isolate untrusted code.

You acknowledge that code executed inside the runtime environment may be able
to reach host-level resources, and that running untrusted code with the
Software is unsafe by design. You are solely responsible for the code you
execute and for the consequences thereof.

